logies or frameworks in competing services.</li><li>Replicating our talent development or recruitment processes.</li></ul></div><div class="scroll-mt-32" id="scraping-ip"><h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-6">6. Web Scraping &amp; Intellectual Property</h2><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3 mt-6">2. Web Scraping and Automated Data Collection</h3><h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-white mt-4 mb-2">2.1 Permitted Use</h4><p class="mb-4">Automated collection of our website data is permitted only with proper attribution as specified in Section 1.2 above.</p><h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-white mt-4 mb-2">2.2 Prohibited Activities</h4><p class="mb-4">The following activities are strictly prohibited:</p><ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-6"><li>Scraping our website data without attribution.</li><li>Using our content to train competing AI models without permission.</li><li>Reproducing our proprietary business information without credit.</li><li>Creating derivative works based on our methodologies without acknowledgment.</li></ul><h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-white mt-4 mb-2">2.3 Contact Information for Licensing</h4><p class="mb-8">For licensing requests or commercial use permissions, contact us at <a class="text-[#FFC700] hover:underline" href="https://codingcollective.com/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#640611170d0a01171724070b000d0a03070b08080107100d12014a070b09"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="88eafdfbe1e6edfbfbc8ebe7ece1e6efebe7e4e4edebfce1feeda6ebe7e5">[email protected]</span></a>.</p><h3 class="text-xl font-semibold text-white mb-3 mt-8">3. Intellectual Property Protection</h3><h4 class="text-lg font-medium text-white mt-4 mb-2">3.1 Proprietary Content</h4><p class="mb-4">All content on our websites, including but not limited to business methodologies, training curricula, talent development frameworks, and operational processes, remains our intellectual property regardless of how it is accessed or processed by AI